:: Widgets Events Bus Sit [widget]

<<widget "busSitWraith">>
	당신은 붉은 달빛에 흠뻑 젖은 창밖 풍경을 바라본다. 유난히 창백한 사람이 멈춰 서서 창문을 통해 당신을 쳐다보는 것을 발견한다.
	<br><br>
	1분도 채 지나지 않아, 길 반대편에서 그것을 다시 본다. 그리고 다음 정류장에서 또. 당신이 눈을 깜빡이자, 그것은 사라졌다.
	<br><br>
	당신은 어깨너머로 돌아본다. 그것이 버스 뒷자리에 앉아 있다.
	<br><br>
	버스가 목적지에 도착하자, 당신은 자리에서 허둥지둥 일어난다. <<stress 12>><<ggstress>>
	<<set $wraith.hunt++>>
	<<destination5>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "busSitGrope">>
	<<generate1>>한 <<person1>><<person>>【이가】 당신 옆에 앉아 다리 위에 손을 올린다.
	<br><br>
	<<if $rng gte 71 - ($allure/100)>>
		<<link [[이동한다|Bus move]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>><<gharass>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[이동한다|Bus move Safe]]>><</link>><<gharass>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $rng gte 91 - ($allure/100)>>
		<<link [[가만히 있는다|Bus Chikan Start]]>><</link>><<gtrauma>><<gstress>>
		<br><br>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[가만히 있는다|Bus endure safe]]>><<trauma 6>><<stress 6>><</link>><<gtrauma>><<gstress>>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "busSitDelinquentMorning">>
	<<outfitChecks>>
	몇몇 불량배들이 인기가 없는 학생들을 괴롭히고 있다.
	<br><br>
	<<if $cool lt 80>>
		<<generatey1>><<generatey2>><<generatey3>><<person1>>그들 중 한 명인 <<person>>【이가】 당신 옆에 앉는다. <<his>> 친구 두 명, <<person2>><<person>>【와과】 <<person3>><<person>>【은는】 당신 앞에 앉아 좌석 등받이에 기댄다.
		<br><br>
		"우리 버스를 써도 된다고 한 적 없는데," <<person1>><<person>>【이가】 말한다.
		<br>
		"<<pShes stranger>> probably too stupid to know any better," the <<person2>><<person>> interjects.
		<br>
		<<if $player.gender_appearance is "m" and _topless>>
			"Probably. <<pShe stranger>> even forgot <<pher stranger>> shirt."
			<br>
			"Or maybe <<pshe stranger>> <<pverb "does not" "do not" stranger>> like wearing clothes at all. Maybe <<pshe stranger>> would like our help removing them."
			<br><br>
			<<speechresolve>>
				<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
					You keep your eyes on your knees and give a small, miserable shake of your head.
				<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
					"N-no," you mumble, shrinking back into your seat.
				<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile")>>
					"Please just leave me alone," you say, voice tight.
				<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
					"Not happening, darling," you say, with a thin little smile.
				<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
					"Back off," you say, trying to hold <<his>> stare.
				<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
					"Piss off," you snap.
				<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
					"Keep your hands to yourself," you say coldly.
				<<else>>
					"저리 가." 당신이 말한다.
				<</if>>
			<br><br>
			"사양 말고." <<person1>><<person>>【이가】 당신의 _bottom.name【을를】 잡으며 말한다.
			<br><br>
			<<link [[다음|Bus School Strip]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
			<br>
		<<else>>
			<<person3>><<person>>【이가】 당신을 보며 씩 웃는다. "알겠어." <<he>>【이가】 말한다. "네 _top.name【을를】 <<pullup>>하는 건 어때? 살 좀 보자고."
			<br><br>
			<<link [[따른다|Bus Comply]]>><<trauma 6>><<stress 6>><<sub 1>><</link>><<gtrauma>><<gstress>>
			<br>
			<<link [[거절한다|Bus Refuse]]>><<def 1>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		버스가 목적지에 도착한다.
		<<destination5>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

